{
  "title": { "zh": "一块网卡", "en": "A network card" },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "搭一块网卡，两个方向同时在走。往下：交来的帧带上校验字节，成帧送到出线上；一帧只在「发送」为 1 的拍开始，「下一个」为 1 的那一拍取走眼前的字节。往上：进线上来的帧拆开、核对，每个内容字节在它后面那个字节收全的那一拍交给上面，「收到」为 1；结尾旗标收完的那一拍「帧尾」为 1，「完好」说出这一帧是否完好。其余各拍「字节」「完好」是「—」，「收到」「帧尾」为 0。",
    "en": "Build a network card, with both directions running at once. Down: frames handed to it go out on the wire out, framed with their check byte; a frame begins only on a tick send is 1, and saying next takes the byte in front of you. Up: frames off the wire in are unwrapped and checked, each content byte going up on the tick the byte after it is complete, with got 1; on the tick the closing flag is complete, end is 1 and intact says whether the frame arrived intact. On every other tick the byte and intact are 「—」, got and end 0."
  },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "发帧、收帧、查错分在几块板上，每一个要用线的节点都得把它们重新接一遍。把它们装进一块网卡：对上面只收发整帧的字节，对下面只收发线上的位，上面不必知道旗标、填充和校验字节。这叫分层。",
        "en": "Sending frames, receiving them and checking them sit on separate boards, and every node that uses a wire would have to wire them up again. Put them in one network card: it deals in the bytes of whole frames with the layer above and in bits on the wire below, and the layer above never sees flags, stuffing or the check byte. This is layering."
      }
    }
  ],
  "wires": {
    "in": [{ "name": "rx", "label": { "zh": "进线", "en": "Wire in" } }],
    "out": [{ "name": "tx", "label": { "zh": "出线", "en": "Wire out" } }]
  },
  "inputs": [
    { "name": "down", "label": { "zh": "队首", "en": "Next byte" } },
    { "name": "last", "label": { "zh": "末字节", "en": "Last byte" } },
    { "name": "send", "label": { "zh": "发送", "en": "Send" } }
  ],
  "outputs": [
    { "name": "next", "label": { "zh": "下一个", "en": "Next" } },
    { "name": "up", "label": { "zh": "字节", "en": "Byte" } },
    { "name": "got", "label": { "zh": "收到", "en": "Got" } },
    { "name": "end", "label": { "zh": "帧尾", "en": "End" } },
    { "name": "ok", "label": { "zh": "完好", "en": "Intact" } }
  ],
  "pulls": { "input": "down", "next": "next", "last": "last" },
